<<<
+ This sergeant cam unto his lord

ageyn, And of Grisildis wordes and hir chere He tolde him point for point, in

short and playn, And him presenteth with his doghter

dere. Somwhat this lord hath rewthe in

his manere; But natheless his purpos heeld he

stille, As lordes doon, whan they wol han

hir wille.
===
+ 	This sergeant cam unto his lord ageyn,
	And of Grisildis wordes and hir chere
	He tolde him point for point, in short and playn,
	And him presenteth with his doghter dere.
	Somwhat this lord hath rewthe in his manere;
	But natheless his purpos heeld he stille,
	As lordes doon, whan they wol han hir wille.
>>>

